From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:37:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sound): reconcile locally predicted interaction and
 mining audio

Java already plays closeable, placement, and mining hit sounds from local prediction. Track the local actions and omit matching Bedrock echoes while keeping events from other actors and positions. Ignore a no-damage attack echo only when it belongs to the player currently mining.
